@gffletch the difference that i drew was more about the `audience` matching. Like in MDM you can predict the audience you're going to accept because you're the owner of the deployment - when your clients are deployed using DCR the `id_token` has an unpredictable `audience` claim value which makes your gateway not supposed to accept that `id_token`

Client trust is one thing but it's more client trust on behalf of another client. Which in the arch would be the gateway acts as an actor in the id-jag flow.

